{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-100","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与平方与比例","englishTitle":"The square on a minor straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a fourth apotome.","book":10,"number":100,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.100","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.100/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":100,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","contentId":"euclid-10-100","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dd8d2d2811ffa6596f2ee2b709df5b90047409282f5b5d2c921df635b3be06b2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-100.statement","euclid-10-100.construction.1","euclid-10-100.construction.2","euclid-10-100.proof.1","euclid-10-100.proof.2","euclid-10-100.proof.3","euclid-10-100.proof.4","euclid-10-100.construction.3","euclid-10-100.proof.5","euclid-10-100.proof.6","euclid-10-100.proof.7","euclid-10-100.proof.8","euclid-10-100.proof.9","euclid-10-100.proof.10","euclid-10-100.proof.11","euclid-10-100.proof.12","euclid-10-100.proof.13","euclid-10-100.proof.14","euclid-10-100.proof.15","euclid-10-100.proof.16","euclid-10-100.proof.17","euclid-10-100.proof.18","euclid-10-100.conclusion","euclid-10-100.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-100.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19746b477c4dea99f6aa32ad558ec1490e8d83a93ce80cedeeb6ce59a8c2c338","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on a minor straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth a fourth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形小直线上对有理线段的宽度为4 截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e72edb13239f179c75b692d85ab076b03302340fc55b000aa2344ba9b482159","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a minor and CD a rational straight line, and to the rational straight line CD let CE be applied equal to the square on AB and producing CF as breadth; I say that CF is a fourth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB未成年,CD有理线段被有理线段被AB被CE被适用,宽度为CF;我说CF是第四个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e86d4ad05e3e0aeda206bef3c24cd757b4d6326e2af4a4a74e58bc860c205d5","citations":["euclid-10-76"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be the annex to AB; therefore AG, GB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on AG, GB rational, but twice the rectangle AG, GB medial. [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG是AB附件,因此,正方形为AG,GB是正方形的直线不可公度,正方形是AG,GB,有理,有理,正方形的正方形,但两倍于矩形,AG,GB,中项无理线段。 [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fac359e61fbee1617ed79d75f7d9792b8e774ebfb2c9134b2eeed5c6a2f5103","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To CD let there be applied CH equal to the square on AG and producing CK as breadth, and KL equal to the square on BG, producing KM as breadth; therefore the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CD应适用CH,等于AG正方形,宽度扩大为CK,宽度扩大为KL,宽度扩大为正方形,宽度扩大为KM;因此,整个CL等于CD,宽度为AG,GB。（相关点与线段：BG）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3409f9bb038b4afd99410a679a662801a9ec11563ed1a3ad69cd6118b74c0cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the sum of the squares on AG, GB is rational; therefore CL is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG,GB的正方形 和有理, 因此CL也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"054c56497fa9d12da23f8396e2e4f8f167b4c989632cfdf806ad348f0573626c","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line CD, producing CM as breadth; therefore CM is also rational and commensurable in length with CD. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到CM宽,因此,CM宽也为有理宽,长度可公度宽CD宽。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b17676c2c145915d5519cc1356e0a6322879c7b44a7131202a0d12339970fca","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and, in these, CE is equal to the square on AB, therefore the remainder FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有因为整个CL等于AG,AG,GB其中,CE等于AB时的正方形。因此,剩余的FL等于矩形 AG,GB的两倍。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"502d377b44b41e3f1152091b0857e1f9785a8339ee072176bb102782a8face51","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then FM be bisected at the point N, and let NO be drawn through N parallel to either of the straight lines CD, ML; therefore each of the rectangles FO, NL is equal to the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后在N点将FM线分成两部分,NO线从N线划过,与CD线中的一条线ML线平行;因此,矩形 FO线NL线中的一条线都等于矩形 AG线GB线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db776032ef2d65657e8cb54726c84c55df8d51009d5a0fe59f0c917befbd5c85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since twice the rectangle AG, GB is medial and is equal to FL, therefore FL is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GB是矩形 AG的两倍, GB是中项无理线段, 等于FL, 所以FL也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f820545a42d40758a6dd65d0cd7557f03e671b953538ce78e2393c7666b0efe","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line FE, producing FM as breadth; therefore FM is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到FM宽,因此,FM长为有理,不可公度长为CD。（相关点与线段：FE） [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4a86512afdc72ffcde734b18a23ffb797761ab8d4ec81036ad9fe5540cc9e5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the sum of the squares on AG, GB is rational, while twice the rectangle AG, GB is medial, the squares on AG, GB are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG正方形GB有理, 和矩形AGGB中项无理线段2倍, AG中项无理线段中项无理线段中项无理线段不可公度不可公度2倍,"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"062c6c7e9a95089c3f19c6129b4269ed41f9e745844c191627b29d0252271995","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and FL equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB; therefore CL is incommensurable with FL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CL等于AG,GB的正方形,GB,FL等于矩形,AG,GB的两倍;因此,CL等于不可公度,FL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"964d1b2458a2c0f4ca46eadcc21fc6242057a3a4b3cc037e17d970c64b7c6b86","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CL is to FL, so is CM to MF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CM is incommensurable in length with MF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CL比FL等于CM比MF,因此,CM比CL等于MF；CL 与 FL 之比等于 CM 与 MF 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9689d66c63909b8fca33480f6a6e8446452b520ecf2c95b52eb0af220454a2f","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore CM, MF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,CM,MF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f29b3c0c270642dfc9c734b612e21e6cbf72b378e9bec519ff83f4ec744cca9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that it is also a fourth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,这也是第四次截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a85c585235449c98c46281dec6e847e67934d621211838918c7e1988bd503d7a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AG, GB are incommensurable in square, therefore the square on AG is also incommensurable with the square on GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为自AG起,正方形起为不可公度起,因此AG起为不可公度起,正方形起为不可公度起。（相关点与线段：GB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f1094a750babcdc62d63e24f6c73f6037e34d957ca9c362dc07f8d6e55de48d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And CH is equal to the square on AG, and KL equal to the square on GB; therefore CH is incommensurable with KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CH等于AG,AG,KL等于正方形,GB,CH等于不可公度,KL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"588fa7ad477af9fc6098a57c5701d6533e499ea2aa9b4378cdb11e83f7f1e441","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to KL, so is CK to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CK is incommensurable in length with KM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH比KL等于CK比KM,因此,CK比CH等于KM；CH 与 KL 之比等于 CK 与 KM 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7064b8e6ff89e0710f2602074fb4b982d9418b0c2a222d0a4ddea52ae20c9217","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AG, GB is a mean proportional between the squares on AG, GB, and the square on AG is equal to CH, the square on GB to KL, and the rectangle AG, GB to NL, therefore NL is a mean proportional between CH, KL; therefore, as CH is to NL, so is NL to KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 AG,GB是比例中项,GB是比例中项,AG是正方形,AG是正方形,GB是正方形,GB是KL,正方形,矩形是AG,GB是NL,NL是比例中项,CH,KL,AG是比例中项,NL,CH,NL是NL,NL；CH 与 NL 之比等于 NL 与 KL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13c9dd7251ef81bd0a4e57654e88a27fb3ecaf79cda0827da9e4e88b65225b11","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to NL, so is CK to NM, and, as NL is to KL, so is NM to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore, as CK is to MN, so is MN to KM; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore the rectangle CK, KM is equal to the square on MN [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)], that is, to the fourth part of the square on FM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH-NL的比等于CK-NM的比,NL-KL的比等于NM-KM的比;因此,CK-MN的比等于MN-KM的比;因此,矩形 CK、KM的比等于MN的正方形,即正方形的第四部分等于FM；CH 与 NL 之比等于 CK 与 NM 之比；NL 与 KL 之比等于 NM 与 KM 之比；CK 与 MN 之比等于 MN 与 KM 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16cd1c975dfaa2e830e781b6c069ee496d38b1cda1652e5c337707022b5fb260","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then CM, MF are two unequal straight lines, and the rectangle CK, KM equal to the fourth part of the square on MF and deficient by a square figure has been applied to CM and divides it into incommensurable parts, therefore the square on CM is greater than the square on MF by the square on a straight line incommensurable with CM. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,CM,MF是两条不平等的直线,矩形,CK,KM等于MF,正方形的第四段,有正方形个数字不足的,已应用于CM,分为不可公度个部分,因此,CM的正方形比MF的正方形要多,而正方形比不可公度和CM的正方形直线要多。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"171793b5f91a4ecc5ff8910cc92444d83a6f9d4307ae8f45b248a79ede59b696","citations":["euclid-10-def-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the whole CM is commensurable in length with the rational straight line CD set out; therefore CF is a fourth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"整个CM是长度可公度,有理线段、CD已经确定, 因此CF是第四截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":22,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-100.source","contentId":"euclid-10-100","revisionId":"euclid-10-100@raw-dd8d2d2811ffa659","order":23,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"321eae6514790326727526c49a6380cc7611bf43e9868007ab7407d7fe2ed03f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.100/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.100\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-100:euclid-10-76:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-100","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-100.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-76","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.100","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.100/","sourceLabel":"X. 76"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-100:euclid-10-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-100","sour